review.reviewBody:
Very good. I also followed other recommendations- 
I increased to 3 tablespoons of poppy seeds;
decreased to 2 cups sugar;
decreased to 1 cup oil;
increased to 2 teaspoons vanilla;
used 1/2 cup lemon juice instead of extract.

My glaze was warmed OJ with powdered sugar, no extract.

And, I baked it in a bundt pan at 350 for ~1hr 15mins and just kept a eye on it.
